    <section class="pageIntro card">
      <h1 class="pageTitle">Clan Setup</h1>
      <p class="sectionDesc">
        Four steps to get fully connected, ready to collect POAPs, and on the roster.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="stepsGrid">
        <article class="stepCard stepCardWide">
          <div class="stepNumber">1</div>
          <h3>Connect with Clan Leaders</h3>
          <p>You must friend King Thing (Thingles) on the Supercell Store to receive the FREE Pass Royale.</p>
          <div class="setupAltConnect">
            <a class="btn btnWhite btnSm" href="https://link.clashroyale.com/?supercell_id&p=16-2db22667-604d-4726-a68d-8f1337d26a5c" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" data-tinylytics-event="setup.connect-thingles">Connect with Thingles</a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="stepCard stepCardWide">
          <div class="stepNumber">2</div>
          <h3>Join the Discord Server</h3>
          <p>Join the <strong>POAP KINGS</strong> Discord server for clan chatter that isn't limited like in-game chat.</p>
          <div class="setupAppLinks">
            <a class="setupAppLink" href="{{ site.discordUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" data-tinylytics-event="setup.join-discord">
              <img src="/assets/icons/discord.png" alt="Discord" class="setupAppIcon" />
              <span>Join POAP KINGS on Discord</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="stepCard stepCardWide">
          <div class="stepNumber">3</div>
          <h3>Install POAP Home</h3>
          <p>This is where you'll mint and manage the POAPs you receive while in the clan.</p>
          <div class="setupAppLinks">
            <a class="setupAppLink" href="https://home.poap.xyz" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" data-tinylytics-event="setup.install-poap-home">
              <img src="/assets/icons/POAP-home.png" alt="POAP Home" class="setupAppIcon" />
              <span>POAP Home</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="stepCard stepCardWide">
          <div class="stepNumber">4</div>
          <h3>Roster Registration</h3>
          <p>Submit the form so your details can be added to the clan website roster.</p>
          <div class="mt-sm">
            <a class="btn btnPrimary btnSm" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeDxNctUtkzBlWQqo8w92hseuqpzbCfHMHUO4W6St5hn9W5AQ/viewform?usp=header" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" data-tinylytics-event="setup.roster-registration">Roster Registration</a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
